        "seq": 19,
        "precision": "unknown"
      },
      "kind": "arrive",
      "place": "house-downstairs",
      "text": "Brently Mallard entered with a latchkey, travel-stained, carrying grip-sack and umbrella, not knowing there had been an accident.",
